ll claims, and one with a Done-when is silent. A lane rewording its Done-when is flagged in its reviewer's brief; at merge an uncovered change mints one done-when adjudication row quoting both texts, idempotently, while a covered change mints no goalposts adjudication and a lane that only ticked with evidence mints none.\""," tier = \"Full\""," expected = \"Satisfies LLR-262: a review session's range may change only its verdict file, checked right after the session and at the merge ladder from the committed logs; a dirty judging session whose leftovers are stashed fails its draw and the review re-runs clean, while one whose leftovers cannot be stashed stops the run needing a human with nothing re-drawn; the loop routes only on committed verdicts in both arms; a round is read as its session committed it; a claim without a Done-when warns; a lane's own Done-when change is flagged to its reviewer and an uncovered change mints a done-when adjudication at merge while a covered change does not.\""," automated = \"Yes\""]},{"oldStart":3312,"oldLines":22,"newStart":3312,"newLines":22,"lines":[" [test.TC-326]"," verifies = [\"SR-156\", \"LLR-307\", \"LLR-309\", \"IF-286\"]"," level = \"Integration\"","-method = \"Run test_a_covering_verdict_releases_the_dispatch_and_the_close, test_an_owner_ruling_binding_the_digest_releases_and_an_unseen_one_does_not, test_a_confirmed_ruling_still_carrying_the_retired_reviewed_key_does_not_release, test_a_rejected_combined_sitting_blesses_nothing, test_a_valid_sitting_with_an_unrequested_section_blesses_nothing, and test_changing_the_text_after_a_verdict_holds_again. Assert each valid covering verdict outcome and a seen matching owner ruling releases; an unseen or retired-key ruling, rejected sitting, or sitting with an unrequested section does not; and a later text change owes a fresh blessing.\"","+method = \"Run test_a_covering_verdict_releases_the_dispatch_and_the_close, test_an_owner_ruling_binding_the_digest_releases_and_an_unseen_one